    "body": "Experimental phone-first build with a local alarm-sound preview and device-sound chooser.\nDefault sound remains until an explicit choice; no system-volume change.\nInstalled-device chooser, chosen-tone playback, loudness and overnight reliability require verification.\nKeep a backup alarm. Install over the existing app without uninstalling or clearing data.\n"
