    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/irvan-putra/kokok/tarball/v0.2.1",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/irvan-putra/kokok/zipball/v0.2.1",
    "body": "Experimental same-signer update. Install over the existing app without uninstalling or clearing data.\n\nFixes a feed-refresh bug that could reset a locally snoozed alarm when an unrelated alarm was added. Snoozed alarms created by this version retain their local next ring when included in a newer feed. Identical scheduled alarms are no longer needlessly rescheduled. Explicit feed removal still cancels feed-managed alarms; ordinary unsnoozed remote edits retain their existing behavior.\n\nImportant: a snooze already active before this update has no new marker. Do not apply a new feed while a legacy snooze may be active. Confirm a quiet state first. This APK alone does not add earlier backup alarms or change existing alarm times. Keep an independent backup for important wakeups.\n\nExact attached bytes passed an API34 in-place upgrade from actual signed0.2.0, preserving synthetic pairing/key/revision/alarm/sound. The existing OS alarm rang after update; real snooze persisted its marker in original storage and the alarm-only direct-boot mirror and survived reopen. Nine focused state tests passed. These checks are not physical-phone, overnight or new cold-boot proof. Optional estimated sleep remains off by default, with no stage/REM/medical claim or automatic wake changes.\n\nPackage com.vanipy.kokok, version0.2.1/code7, same certificate348db420e3de18754e972bbd4f72a7255159fdde481d73510850d6cec795ee2f.\nSHA2567188f55d6c24fe32ed42cf2617e0a48132729f18b65c5e3de0113928c8fd57b9.\nQualification: https://github.com/irvan-putra/kokok/actions/runs/44701088941\nSource: https://github.com/irvan-putra/kokok/commit/7f84bfc3cfe260c701bcf9752936ff00b4578767\n"
  },
